FOG008	flat	-FOG/CPM.008			BIOS141 .GEN	3F73				Instructions for assembling the Osborne 1 bios with ACT80	**The one disk that matters to this project directly.** Osborne 1 BIOS and monitor ROM source: ROM144.ASM, OCCBIO05-95.ASM, OCCRAM15/25.ASM and RELEASE.TXT -- the letter in which Osborne permitted FOG to reprint the BIOS listing. Ten of the seventeen files are byte-identical to the copy in this repo; the rest differ only by CRLF and CP/M padding. An independent second copy of the firmware source (#203).	The firmware source, on a user-group disk, free. This is the disk that makes the O1NEXT's ROM 2.0 (#83) a reconstruction rather than a guess, and it is the reason the library belongs on the machine. Also a great way for you to experiment with adding your own features to a ROM. REMEMBER THE SIZE LIMITS THOUGH!!!!!
